ZH("Look around Goomba Village and talk to Goompa.", "在栗子村四处看看，和酷栗爷爷谈谈。")
ZH("Goompa fell off the cliff. Find him below, then search the forest's bushes for a Hammer.", "酷栗爷爷从悬崖上掉下去了。到下面找到他，然后在森林的草丛里找锤子。")
ZH("Beat Jr. Troopa in the forest playground, then go back up to Goomba Village.", "在森林的游乐场打败喏库蛋仔，然后回到栗子村。")
ZH("Smash the block on the village gate with your Hammer and follow Goomba Road east to the Goomba King.", "用锤子敲碎村门上的砖块，沿着栗子小路往东走，去找栗子王。")
ZH("Find the switch near the Goomba King's fort to lower the bridge to Toad Town.", "在栗子王的城堡附近找到开关，放下通往蘑菇镇的桥。")
ZH("Go through Toad Town and up to Shooting Star Summit, where the Star Spirits are waiting.", "穿过蘑菇镇，登上流星之峰，星之魂在那里等着你。")
ZH("Talk to Merlon in Toad Town, then take Pleasant Path east. Where it ends at a gap, hit the tree with your Hammer.", "在蘑菇镇和莫隆谈谈，然后沿着温暖小道往东走。在路断开的地方，用锤子敲那棵树。")
ZH("Hit the switch that fell from the tree to make a bridge, and go on to Koopa Village.", "敲一下从树上掉下来的开关搭起桥，然后去喏库喏库村。")
ZH("Help the Koopas with the Fuzzies, then chase the one that took Kooper's shell into the woods.", "帮喏库们赶走绒毛怪，然后追进树林，找到拿走卡米龟龟壳的那只。")
ZH("With Kooper, make the next bridge on Pleasant Path past Koopa Village and go on to Koopa Bros. Fortress.", "和卡米龟一起在喏库喏库村后面的温暖小道上搭起下一座桥，然后去喏库兄弟要塞。")
ZH("Look for keys in the fortress. When you fall into the dungeon, talk to the Bob-omb in the cell.", "在要塞里找钥匙。掉进地牢后，和牢房里的炸弹兵谈谈。")
ZH("Bombette can blow up cracked walls. Climb the fortress and beat the Koopa Bros.", "炸弹妞可以炸开有裂缝的墙。爬上要塞，打败喏库兄弟。")
ZH("Head back to Toad Town along Pleasant Path.", "沿着温暖小道回到蘑菇镇。")
ZH("Go to the train station in the south of Toad Town. Clear what blocks the tracks and ride to Mt. Rugged.", "去蘑菇镇南边的火车站。清除挡住铁轨的东西，坐火车去乱石山。")
ZH("A Paratroopa mail carrier lost three letters on Mt. Rugged. Find them and bring them back to him.", "一个送信的啪嗒啪嗒在乱石山上丢了三封信。找到它们并交还给他。")
ZH("Parakarry carries you over gaps. Cross Mt. Rugged, then head east across Dry Dry Desert to Dry Dry Outpost.", "帕瑞塔可以带你飞过空隙。穿过乱石山，再往东穿过干旱沙漠，到达干旱村落。")
ZH("In Dry Dry Outpost, talk to the Nomadimouse hiding his face in the back of town. Fruit from the oasis south of town makes him talk.", "在干旱村落，和躲在村子深处遮着脸的老鼠谈谈。村子南边绿洲的水果能让他开口。")
ZH("Check the door where he waited and climb onto the rooftops. The town's leader is up there.", "检查他之前等着的那扇门，爬上屋顶。村子的头领就在上面。")
ZH("Walk the desert with the Pulse Stone. Where it flashes fastest, put it on the small rock.", "带着闪光石在沙漠里走。在它闪得最快的地方，把它放在小石头上。")
ZH("In Dry Dry Ruins, drain the sand, find the Super Hammer, and put the Pyramid, Diamond and Lunar Stones in place.", "在干旱废墟里排掉沙子，找到超级锤子，再把金宇塔之石、钻石和月之石放到对的位置。")
ZH("Take the new stairs to the bottom of the ruins and beat Tutankoopa.", "走新出现的楼梯到废墟最深处，打败金面龟。")
ZH("Return to Toad Town and go to the gate of Forever Forest, near Tayce T.'s house.", "回到蘑菇镇，去凯茜家附近迷失森林的入口。")
ZH("Go into Forever Forest. To find your way, take the path that looks different from the others.", "进入迷失森林。要找到路，就走那条看起来和别的路不一样的路。")
ZH("Go into Boo's Mansion and look around for a Record.", "进入嘘嘘鬼大厦，四处找找唱片。")
ZH("Play the Record on the phonograph to distract a Boo and take the Weight. Hang it from the chandelier by the sofa.", "用留声机放唱片引开嘘嘘鬼，拿到重物。把它挂到沙发旁边的吊灯上。")
ZH("Go through the door the glass case hid and down to the storeroom. Win the Boos' game for new Boots.", "穿过玻璃柜挡住的门，下到储藏室。赢下嘘嘘鬼的游戏，得到新的鞋子。")
ZH("Spin Jump through boarded floors to find Boo's Portrait and hang it back up. A Boo takes you upstairs.", "用旋转跳踩穿钉着木板的地板，找到嘘嘘鬼的画像并挂回去。一个嘘嘘鬼会带你上楼。")
ZH("With Bow, head through Gusty Gulch to Tubba Blubba's Castle.", "和咻咻一起穿过风啸谷，去图巴・布路巴城堡。")
ZH("Find keys to get through the castle. Tubba Blubba sleeps upstairs: sneak to the chest by his bed.", "找钥匙穿过城堡。图巴・布路巴在楼上睡觉：悄悄走到他床边的宝箱那里。")
ZH("Run! Get out of the castle before Tubba Blubba catches you.", "快跑！在图巴・布路巴抓住你之前逃出城堡。")
ZH("The talking key opens Windy Mill in Gusty Gulch. Go down its well and chase Tubba Blubba's heart.", "会说话的钥匙能打开风啸谷的风车小屋。下到井里，追赶图巴・布路巴的心脏。")
ZH("Follow the heart back to Tubba Blubba and beat him.", "跟着心脏回到图巴・布路巴那里，打败他。")
ZH("Head back to Toad Town.", "回到蘑菇镇。")
ZH("Shy Guys are causing trouble in Toad Town. Watch the second house west of the shop in the south. Bow can hide you.", "嘿虎们在蘑菇镇捣乱。注意南边商店往西第二间房子。咻咻可以让你隐身。")
ZH("In Shy Guy's Toy Box, find the Storeroom Key and give it back to the shopkeeper in the south of Toad Town.", "在嘿虎的玩具盒里找到储藏室钥匙，还给蘑菇镇南边商店的老板。")
ZH("Take the Toy Train from his storeroom and put it into the Toy Box from outside.", "从他的储藏室拿走玩具火车，从外面把它放进玩具盒。")
ZH("Ride the train through the Toy Box, find Tayce T.'s Frying Pan and bring it back to her.", "坐火车穿过玩具盒，找到凯茜的煎盘，拿回去还给她。")
ZH("Give the Cake to the hungry Gourmet Guy in the Toy Box.", "把蛋糕给玩具盒里饿肚子的美食家嘿虎。")
ZH("On the moving walkways, hide with Bow to slip past. Then hit the colored blocks in the right order.", "在传送带上用咻咻隐身溜过去。然后按正确的顺序敲彩色砖块。")
ZH("In the dark rooms, beat the Big Lantern Ghost and free the light it carries.", "在黑暗的房间里打败大灯笼鬼，救出它拿着的光。")
ZH("Watt lights up dark rooms. Follow the Shy Guys running from the light to General Guy and beat him.", "霹雳小妞能照亮黑暗的房间。跟着躲避光线的嘿虎找到嘿虎将军，打败他。")
ZH("Go to the port in Toad Town and hit the strange island by the docks.", "去蘑菇镇的港口，敲一敲码头边那座奇怪的岛。")
ZH("The whale has a bellyache: go into its mouth and help. Then it takes you to Lavalava Island.", "鲸鱼肚子疼：进到它嘴里帮帮它。然后它会带你去火山岛。")
ZH("Go through Jade Jungle to Yoshi's Village. When the Yoshi kids go missing, find their babysitter first.", "穿过绿色丛林去耀西村。耀西宝宝们不见了的时候，先去找照顾他们的人。")
ZH("Find all five Yoshi kids in Jade Jungle. Sushie lets you swim.", "在绿色丛林里找到全部五个耀西宝宝。苏莎阿姨能让你游泳。")
ZH("Put the Jade Raven from the village chief on the big stone statue, and follow the new path to a giant tree.", "把村长给的小雕像放到大石像上，沿着新出现的路走到一棵巨大的树那里。")
ZH("Climb the giant tree and talk to Raphael the Raven. He'll get you to Mt. Lavalava.", "爬上巨大的树，和丛林的守护神谈谈。他会帮你去火山。")
ZH("Inside Mt. Lavalava, slow the lava with the blue blocks and find the Ultra Hammer.", "在火山里用蓝色砖块挡住岩浆，找到终极锤子。")
ZH("Smash the stone blocks with the Ultra Hammer and go deep into the volcano.", "用终极锤子敲碎石块，深入火山内部。")
ZH("The volcano is erupting! Run back out.", "火山爆发了！快跑出去。")
ZH("The eruption threw a chest into the jungle near where you met Sushie. Bring what's inside to Kolorado.", "火山爆发把一个宝箱炸飞到了丛林里，就在你遇见苏莎阿姨的地方附近。把里面的东西交给查尔斯。")
ZH("Ride the whale back to Toad Town.", "坐鲸鱼回到蘑菇镇。")
ZH("Bring four Magical Seeds (Toad Town, Forever Forest, Jade Jungle, Mt. Rugged) to Minh T. in Toad Town.", "把四颗魔法种子（蘑菇镇、迷失森林、绿色丛林、乱石山）交给蘑菇镇的莉波。")
ZH("In Flower Fields, help the flower east of the big tree: Monty Moles are bothering her.", "在鲜花原野，帮帮大树东边的那朵花：黄鼹鼠在捣乱。")
ZH("Smash the tree near Petunia for a Red Berry and give it to the hungry red flower. The flower past his gate has Fertile Soil.", "敲小花旁边的树得到红浆果，交给饥饿的红花。他门后面的那朵花有沃土。")
ZH("A Yellow Berry opens the yellow flower's gate. Get a Crystal Berry from Posie and trade it to Rosie for the Water Stone.", "黄浆果能打开黄花的门。从水晶树那里得到水晶浆果，再和花园里的玫瑰换水之石。")
ZH("Put the Water Stone in the dry spring past the yellow flower's gate.", "把水之石放进黄花门后面干涸的泉水里。")
ZH("Find the Sun in Flower Fields and hear him out. On the way back, a Lakitu gets in your way.", "在鲜花原野找到太阳，听他说话。回来的路上，会有一个朱盖木挡住你。")
ZH("Ride Lakilester, stomp the colored blocks in the right order, and smash the Puff Puff Machine.", "骑上朱库比，按正确的顺序踩彩色砖块，打坏造云的机器。")
ZH("Ask the Wise Wisterwood for advice. Then plant in order: Fertile Soil, the Magical Bean, Miracle Water.", "向那棵智慧之树请教。然后按顺序种下：沃土、魔豆、奇迹之水。")
ZH("Climb the beanstalk above the clouds and beat Huff N. Puff.", "顺着魔豆藤爬到云上，打败云雾老怪。")
ZH("Return to Toad Town and talk to Merlon.", "回到蘑菇镇，和莫隆谈谈。")
ZH("Get the Ultra Boots deep in Toad Town Tunnels. Then find a blue door on a high ledge: Watt shows the hidden blocks.", "在蘑菇镇地道深处得到旋风跳。然后找到高台上的一扇蓝门：霹雳小妞能照出隐藏的砖块。")
ZH("In Shiver City, visit the Mayor Penguin. If you get blamed for trouble, find Herringway past the frozen pond.", "在酷冰冰村拜访村长。如果有人怪你，就到结冰的池塘那边找宫贝先生。")
ZH("Take the snowy path west of Shiver City across Shiver Snowfield to Starborn Valley.", "沿着酷冰冰村西边的雪路穿过酷冰冰雪原，去诞星谷。")
ZH("In Starborn Valley, talk to Merle.", "在诞星谷和莫利谈谈。")
ZH("Go back to Shiver City: the Mayor Penguin has a treasure for you too.", "回到酷冰冰村：村长也有宝物要给你。")
ZH("Put the Scarf and the Bucket on the snowmen by the cliff so they all look the same.", "把围巾和桶戴到悬崖边的雪人身上，让它们看起来都一样。")
ZH("Climb Shiver Mountain and break the cracked wall. In the icy cave, don't trust your eyes: keep walking.", "爬上酷冰冰雪山，打破有裂缝的墙。在冰洞里别相信你的眼睛：继续往前走。")
ZH("Use the Star Stone at the top of Shiver Mountain to reach the Crystal Palace.", "在酷冰冰雪山山顶使用星之石，前往水晶宫殿。")
ZH("In the Crystal Palace, what you do on one side of the glass happens on the other. Watch out for copycats.", "在水晶宫殿里，你在镜子一边做的事情会在另一边发生。小心模仿你的家伙。")
ZH("Find the room under a statue. Talk to the Albino Dinos to turn them and push the statues into place.", "找到雕像下面的房间。和石像怪说话让它们转身，再把雕像推到对的位置。")
ZH("Beat the Crystal King. Two of the three kings are fakes: hit them all.", "打败水晶王。三个王里有两个是假的：把它们全部打中。")
ZH("Go to Shooting Star Summit. The Star Spirits are waiting there.", "去流星之峰。星之魂在那里等着你。")
ZH("Climb the Star Way to Star Haven and ride the Star Ship to Bowser's Castle.", "沿着星星之路登上星之国，乘坐星之船前往酷霸王城堡。")
ZH("Make your way up through Bowser's Castle to Princess Peach's Castle.", "穿过酷霸王城堡，前往桃花公主城堡。")
ZH("Climb to the top of Peach's Castle and beat Bowser!", "登上桃花公主城堡的顶端，打败酷霸王！")
ZH("You saved the Mushroom Kingdom! See what's left on the Found and Achievements pages.", "你拯救了蘑菇王国！看看收集页和成就页上还剩下什么。")
ZH("You're Princess Peach for now. Look around the castle: Twink can help.", "现在你是桃花公主。在城堡里四处看看：汀克能帮你。")
